<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill raises Dura.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill raises Dura.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said analyst Richard Vietor had raised Dura Pharmaceuticals to near-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- said kept the long-term rating as buy.</p>
<p>-- additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- stock gained 2-3/16 to 39-1/4.</p>
